# Claude #2: higher dimensions. Side 3 in 5D, then the 5x5x5 sea (which froze from one polyp) with random starts.
use tide2_reefnd
1500 602 bury
." side 3, 5D (243 spots), one polyp: " 3 600 bury 5 601 bury polyp . ." found at year " 501 dig . 10 emit
." side 3, 6D (729 spots), one polyp: " 3 600 bury 6 601 bury polyp . ." found at year " 501 dig . 10 emit
." side 5, 3D, one polyp freezes at year: " 5 600 bury 3 601 bury polyp drop 501 dig . 10 emit
